# The container builds (src/python-api, src/DotnetApi, src/blazor, src/java-api,
# src/kotlin-api) use the repo root as build context, so trim it to what their
# Dockerfiles actually COPY. Without this the daemon would ship
# infra/node_modules and build/ (tens of MB) on every build.
.git
.idea
build
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/target
**/.gradle
**/build
*.zip
